  "published": "2026-07-26T18:49:43.033Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-beta.3 wrapping ZVec C++ 0.5.1. OpenOrCreate + DI OpenMode (default OpenOrCreate). Linux Auto teardown suppresses native close/shutdown to avoid SIGSEGV (alibaba/zvec#619) until upstream fix. Apache-2.0 license. Shipped natives: win-x64, linux-x64, osx-arm64, android-arm64, android-x64. Not yet: win-arm64, linux-arm64, osx-x64, ios-arm64, iossimulator-arm64, maccatalyst-arm64 — blocked by cross-building zvec bundled third parties (Arrow, FastPFOR/SIMDe, Lz4, host protoc); ships when CI is hard-green and pack always includes the RID. See README Native RIDs. CHANGELOG.md for full notes.",
